        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Loic Courteau, Pam Shriver, Catarina Lindqvist\n- Roles: coach, defending champion\n- Events: 1985 Edgbaston Cup – Singles\n\nFacts:\n- Loic Courteau coached Pam Shriver.\n- Pam Shriver was born in 1962, so she was alive in the 1960s.\n- Catarina Lindqvist was the defending champion in the 1985 Edgbaston Cup – Singles.\n- Catarina Lindqvist was born in 1963, so she was also alive in the 1960s.\n- Therefore, the statement that the player Loic Courteau coached and the other tennis player were not both alive in the 1960s is false.",
